{"url": "https://x.com/RayFernando1337/status/2090588423350616494", "id": "2090588423350616494", "text": "I Turned Grok Bot Into My CTO. I hand that bot the GitHub repo and tell it to run the show, so it spins up cloud agents off my machine, follows the PRs, and reaches for poteto-mode when a task actually needs the rigor. \n\nThen comes the second prompt, where I tell it that it is overloaded and it should hire child bots that report to it. After that the bots talk to each other instead of talking to me. One lands the PRs, one works the Convex backend, one owns auth, and I read the threads view-only.  \n\nTwo honest things before you copy this. It burns tokens. I went past two billion in a single day because I told my bot to use pstack for everything, and the fix was saving pstack for the hard tasks. And it does not replace engineers. It takes me out of the coordinating seat, which is a different claim.\n\nTimestamps\n00:00 The Grok Bot CTO Workflow\n01:23 Direct Responsible Agent Prompt\n04:20 pstack Plugin and poteto Mode\n08:46 Token Consumption Warning\n11:49 Spinning Up a Team of Bots\n17:20 Advanced GrokBot Use Cases", "raw_text": {"text": "I Turned Grok Bot Into My CTO. I hand that bot the GitHub repo and tell it to run the show, so it spins up cloud agents off my machine, follows the PRs, and reaches for poteto-mode when a task actually needs the rigor. \n\nThen comes the second prompt, where I tell it that it is overloaded and it should hire child bots that report to it. After that the bots talk to each other instead of talking to me. One lands the PRs, one works the Convex backend, one owns auth, and I read the threads view-only.  \n\nTwo honest things before you copy this. It burns tokens. I went past two billion in a single day because I told my bot to use pstack for everything, and the fix was saving pstack for the hard tasks. And it does not replace engineers. It takes me out of the coordinating seat, which is a different claim.\n\nTimestamps\n00:00 The Grok Bot CTO Workflow\n01:23 Direct Responsible Agent Prompt\n04:20 pstack Plugin and poteto Mode\n08:46 Token Consumption Warning\n11:49 Spinning Up a Team of Bots\n17:20 Advanced GrokBot Use Cases", "display_text_range": [0, 1023], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [278, 301], "id": "2090584853473611776", "display": "pic.x.com/mGXO3Fllsq", "original": "https://t.co/mGXO3Fllsq", "replacement": "https://x.com/RayFernando1337/status/2090588423350616494/video/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "RayFernando1337", "url": "https://x.com/RayFernando1337", "id": "1691669297637277696", "followers": 38622, "following": 5644, "likes": 75090, "media_count": 2468, "name": "Ray Fernando", "description": "12y ex-Apple \u2022 Building live with AI \u2022\u00a0Current Mission: 10% Body Fat", "raw_description": {"text": "12y ex-Apple \u2022 Building live with AI \u2022\u00a0Current Mission: 10% Body Fat", "facets": []}, "location": "Bay Area \ud83e\udd19\ud83c\udffd Hawaii", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1691669297637277696/1745791289", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1764104074772000768/XcLXXaib_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Aug 16 04:32:55 +0000 2023", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "https://rfer.me/RayYouTube", "display_url": "rfer.me/RayYouTube"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "avatar_color": null}, "replies": 22, "retweets": 8, "likes": 297, "bookmarks": 323, "quotes": 8, "created_at": "Thu Aug 20 23:54:56 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1787270096, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 760220, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": null, "media": {"all": [{"id": "2090584853473611776", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090584853473611776/vid/avc1/3804x2160/3JHVcwv2lTgeVZuw.mp4?tag=29", "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2090584853473611776/img/uhAYBj_kBWYprc4m.jpg", "dur